'''Ginger Snache''' (赤毛のにょろ, ''Akage no Nyoro'', '''Redhead Nyoro''') is a [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]] variant of [[Snache]] that appears in [[Legend Stages]], [[Into the Future]], [[Cats of the Cosmos]], and [[The Aku Realms]]. He was added in [[Version 3.0 Update|Version 3.0]].

