==Enemy==
Unlike fellow Red peon [[B.B.Bunny]], Ginger Snache can pose an actual threat, with non-stop attacks, very high damage, more knockbacks and speed. Despite being single-target, his DPS and tendency to be spammed can make him almost impossible to just stall.

==Strategy==
Try to focus on numbers rather than slow-moving powerhouses like [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]], as Ginger Snache can push hard if there's nothing around to knock him back. [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Whale Cat]], [[Crazed Fish Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Whale Cat]] and other [[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|anti-Red units]] can quickly kill Ginger Snache, as well as spammable mid-ranged attackers like [[Mer-Cat (Rare Cat)|Cameraman Cat]] and [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]].

